 ],
 "note": "Refused terminal-v1 requests get terminal-v1 error{terminal_id, stream_id, code, message}; a chat-v1 submit hears only chat-v1 ops mapped from its receipt (accepted/executing -> accepted, completed -> complete{outcome:done, turnId}, rejected/outcome_unknown -> error{code, text}), never a session receipt; removed and undecodable family requests get a session error."
}